#!/usr/bin/env jacl
#{ version: tour }

## A whirlwind tour of every implemented JACL feature.
## Each section is independent; ordering roughly mirrors SYNTAX.md.
## Run with: .build/jacl_harness demo/feature_tour.jacl

# expect: hello, world
